<title>UK: Abbey National sets 150 mln Ecu one-year bond.</title>
<headline>Abbey National sets 150 mln Ecu one-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers CCF and CIC Paris.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ABBEY NATIONAL TREASURY SERVICES</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  ABBEY NATIONAL PLC</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN ECU   COUPON     4.125     MATURITY    21.AUG.98</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.83    PAY DATE    21.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.0	 REOFFER    99.93     SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA	  MGT/UND    10 BP     SELL CONC   90 BP</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
